	<svg viewBox="0 0 900 220" width="900" class="mx-auto block h-auto max-w-full" role="img" aria-label="Cache-aside: the reader asks Redis first, reads Postgres on a miss and fills Redis with a TTL; the invalidator deletes the key when the data changes">
